        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG133, Dove Tail Door Leverset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe gentle curving shape of the Dove Tail Door Lever is a unique look that adds a point of interest to the static feel contemporary decor can have. This modern lever is made from 304 solid stainless steel and is a part of AHI Hardware's Sigma Series. Available in polished or satin stainless steel finishes, this lever and rose set can be adjusted for 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Dove Tail Leverset is easy to install and will fit all 2-1/8 inch pre-drilled doors. It is ADA compliant and is suitable for both residential and commercial applications. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG133-specifications.gif?v=1704354554\" width=\"600\" height=\"142\" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI SIG133 Specifications\"> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the AHI SIG133 Stainless Steel Dove Tail Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For residential or commercial applications</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors)</li>\r\n<li>Field reversible tubular latch</li>\r\n<li>Premium latch requires only 28° rotation to retract latchbolt</li>\r\n<li>Meets standards of the <a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the SIG133 Stainless Steel Dove Tail Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/16\" (129 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/8\" (60 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Spindle Width: 0.31\" (8 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-7/16\" (62 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a door pull or to match trim. Trim is on one side of door. Lever is surface mounted (mounting plate screws to the doors face).</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. For use with a standard 2-1/8\" bore hole pre-drilled door. </li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: Single Dummy is Handed</b>. All other functions are non-handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Dove Tail Door Leverset, AHI SIG133",
                "description": "The gentle curving shape of the Dove Tail Door Lever is a unique look that adds a point of interest to the static feel contemporary decor can have. This modern lever is made from 304 solid stainless steel and is a part of AHI Hardware's Sigma Series. Available in polished or satin stainless steel finishes, this lever and rose set can be adjusted for 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Dove Tail Leverset is easy to install and will fit all 2-1/8 inch pre-drilled doors. It is ADA compliant and is suitable for both residential and commercial applications. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n",
                "keywords": "AHI-SIG133, AHI SIG133, ada compliant levers, modern door levers, contemporary door levers, safety code compliant levers, ahi sigma line levers, Dove Tail Door Levers, Dove Tail Door Leversets, AHI stainless steel levers,"
